Third-party data
----------------

This licence covers the source code and the fields this project adds to
existing corpora (`statut`, `stabilite`, `taxonomie`, `accord` in
`exports/webvoyager_verified_v0.1.jsonl`).

It does NOT cover the benchmark corpora and patch-sets the tool reads. Those
are not redistributed here (`data/raw/` is not versioned); they are downloaded
at pinned revisions from their own repositories and remain under their own
licences — WebVoyager (MinorJerry/WebVoyager), Magnitude, browser-use,
Skyvern, Convergence, Microsoft Fara, Alumnium, Emergence AI, Online-Mind2Web.
Check each source before redistributing.
